The router client (src/tplink-api.js, src/crypto.js, src/read.js) is a new
JavaScript implementation of the login and request protocol of the TP-Link /
Mercusys web page. The protocol (form paths, key exchange, encryption and
signature schemes, answer fields) was learned by studying the tplinkrouterc6u
Python library, Copyright Alex Erohin and contributors
(https://github.com/AlexandrErohin/TP-Link-Archer-C6U). No code nor file of
that library is included or translated in this product.

